  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "@zakza/dsh-truth-gate",
      "text": "Native DeepSeek Harness plugin that verifies coding-agent claims (tests passed, file edited, …) against tool receipts.\n\n- **Default mode: `shadow`** (record only; does not steer).\n- Requires **Python ≥ 3.11** on PATH (ships `opc_truth` pure-stdlib engine under `python/`).\n- Compatible with DSH **0.2.1-rc.3** and **0.2.1-rc.4**."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "from npm (preferred)",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile <profile> add @zakza/dsh-truth-gate"
    },
    {
      "section": "or local tarball / checkout",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile <profile> add ./zakza-dsh-truth-gate-0.1.0.tgz\ndsh plugin --profile <profile> add ./dsh-truth-gate\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Config",
      "text": "```yaml"
    },
    {
      "section": "cordis.patch.yml / plugin config",
      "text": "mode: shadow          # off | shadow | gate\npython: python        # interpreter\nrequireProtocol: true\nloopLimit: 3\ntimeoutMs: 15000\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Smoke",
      "text": "```powershell\npowershell -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File scripts/smoke.ps1 -ProfileName truthgate-dev\n```"
    }
  ],
